  top-level work into a role function or into the book; an oracle file is loaded
  for its definitions, never run.
        [ oracle.sh:2:1
     2 | eval "one"
       | \__/
  2:1 info [unmodeled-inventory:unmodeled-wall-inventory] this book carries 2 unmodeled walls -- constructs Dorc cannot analyze, past which no probe result can be trusted; the first is here, and the ~3 command site(s) after it fall back to runtime guards instead of full elision.
